## 2. Skill Suites & Collections (Individual Upstream Licenses)

This repository serves as an offline cold-storage warehouse for skill playbooks authored and maintained by various independent teams and communities across the AI/agent ecosystem.

**All individual skill suites, packages, and collections retain their own respective upstream licenses.**

- Each skill directory under [`skills/`](skills/), [`canonical/`](canonical/), and [`collections/`](collections/) is governed by the `LICENSE`, `LICENSE.txt`, or license declarations specified in its own directory and frontmatter.
- Where a skill directory or vendored collection does not contain a dedicated license file, its terms are governed by its upstream source repository.
- Please refer directly to the respective skill folder or collection for its governing terms before redistributing or reusing individual playbooks.